    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Gregoryarm.0003.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Majestic art Thou above the majestic; greatness beyond utterance is in Thee. Glorious art Thou and we glorify Thee, who art above the holy ones and wonderful is Thy glory.",
