    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Gregoryarm.0003.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "So we too Thy humble servants, with hands outstretched and raised, making the sign of Thy cross to glorify Thee and praise Thee; and the Seraphim and the Cherubim also that have each six wings.",
