    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Gregoryarm.0016",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And thus make ye memorial of Me—Thou didst say unto them—as often as ye eat this bread and drink this cup, proclaiming My death and being raised in My resurrection, and confessing (it).",
