    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Gregoryarm.0022.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "O Lord, who upholdest all, we pray and beseech Thee that as Thou hast granted us a part in this pure and holy mystery we may be transformed into Thine essence by Thy Godhead in this bread,",
