    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Gregoryarm.0022.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Join (us) to Thine inheritance in Thy heavenly kingdom by Thine only Son, by whom to Thee, with Him and with the Holy Spirit, be glory and power now and ever and world without end. Amen.",
